  "description": "A retro looptail frame design and throwback Robot graphics give the Legend a nod to DK’s early days.\n\n“Legend” is not a term to be taken lightly and we aren’t making small talk with the DK Legend 26”. It’s a big bike with big goals: To be ridden hard and ridden frequently. This year, we moved back to classic chrome and added a pad set that really makes this thing jump. The throwback looptail frame stays to give a nod to 70’s BMX design with a stable, comfortable stance, while the specs are performance minded without blowing the price. 26” double-wall alloy rims are mounted with grippy 26 x 2.1” tires for a smooth and comfortable ride. For stopping power and wheelie control, a V-brake handles the tasks. Whether you want to rip hard, roll fast, or just cruise around, the Legend has your back.\n\nCranks Wise tubular chromoly 3-piece, 170mm, 8-spline spindle\n\nSprocket DK 25-tooth, steel\n\nChain KMC Z-510\n\nPedals DK Blender PC platform\n\nRims Wise Rectrix2, double wall, 36mm wide, 36-hole\n\nFront Hub Fully sealed, 3/8” chromoly axle\n\nRear Hub Fully sealed, 14mm chromoly axle, 11-tooth driver\n\nTires 26x2.1” multi-surface design, 65psi\n\nSeat DK Railed\n\nSeat Post Micro-adjust, 25.4mm, alloy\n\nSeat Post Clamp Alloy\n\nExtra Features 3D head tube badge, padset included (2-pieces)\n\nWeight 28.5 lbs",
